# Tes Modul 5 — jalankan berurutan dari atas ke bawah.
# Token TIDAK perlu dicopas: REST Client mengambilnya otomatis
# dari response request bernama "login" dan "refresh".

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Daftar (harus 201, role selalu "user" walau dikirim "admin")
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sari",
  "email": "sari@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Password lemah ditolak (harus 422 "password terlalu umum")
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "budi",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password1"
}

### 4. Akses tanpa token (harus 401 + header WWW-Authenticate)
GET {{base}}/users

### 5a. Login password salah (harus 401)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sari",
  "password": "salahsekali9"
}

### 5b. Login username tidak ada (harus 401, pesannya SAMA PERSIS dengan 5a)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tidakada",
  "password": "salahsekali9"
}

### 6. Login benar (harus 200, expires_in 900)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sari",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### 7a. Profil sendiri pakai access token (harus 200)
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 7b. Daftar user pakai access token (harus 200)
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### 8. Token diubah ujungnya (harus 401 "access token tidak valid")
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}rusak

### 9a. Refresh pertama (harus 200)
# @name refresh
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refresh_token}}"
}

### 9b. Refresh token LAMA dipakai lagi (harus 401 — rotasi bekerja)
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.$.data.refresh_token}}"
}

### 11. Logout pakai refresh token yang baru (harus 200)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refresh.response.body.$.data.refresh_token}}"
}
